@ResearchCommons.Claims.CriticalTailPorts.actual_encoded_periodic_realization : ∀ {k : ℕ}
  (p : PopulationCounting.InfiniteLabeledPopulation k k) (base : ℕ) (hr : PortEncoding.Regular p base) {M period : ℕ},
